M8 8NN, United Kingdom, Financial Stability & Long-Term Commitment, WHOOSH Finance has been founded with a clear long-term vision and strong financial foundations. Thanks to the success of our directors' previous ventures, we begin with a healthy starting balance and no dependency on early deal income.

This allows us to focus on building a sustainable, relationship-led business — investing properly in people, systems, compliance, and lender partnerships from day one., Meet the WHOOSH Team, Behind every great business is a passionate team. Our Whoosh caricatures represent the friendly, approachable culture we bring to motor finance—making it easy for both customers and partners to work with us., [{"team_member_image":"whoosh-team-image\/01KDTAVQWEYHHGPJEQPVW2PEEB.png","team_member_name":"Alan J Rowe (AJ)","team_member_designation":" CEO & Partner","team_member_description":"With 10+ years across every corner of motor finance - from sales floors to operations, dealer relationships to finance management - AJ has seen it all and knows what works (and what doesn't!). Now he's on a mission to shake things up and make car finance actually enjoyable."}], Key Business Metrics, [{"business_metrics_value":"\u00a3185K","business_metrics_text":"Year 1 Revenue Target"}], 3-Year Financial Projections, [{"year_title":"Year 1","year_1_total_revenue":"\u00a3185,000","year_1_total_text":"Total Revenue","estimated_deals_title":"Estimated Deals","estimated_deals_value":"~370 deals","net_profit_title":"Net Profit","net_profit_value":"\u00a310,313","profit_margin_title":"Profit Margin","profit_margin_value":"5.6%"}], Our Target Audience, At WHOOSH Finance, we focus on well-qualified, motivated customers who value a simple, transparent, and efficient finance experience. Our audience represents individuals and families who are actively looking to upgrade their current vehicle, enhance their lifestyle, or explore the leisure-vehicle market rather than those seeking entry-level credit solutions., Established Professionals (27–54), Customers with stable incomes and solid credit profiles who are upgrading or refinancing their current vehicle and seeking competitive, straightforward finance options., Lifestyle & Leisure Buyers, Individuals and families investing in campervans, caravans, or motorhomes — looking to expand their lifestyle opportunities through flexible, reliable finance., Business Owners & Self-Employed Drivers, Professionals and small-business owners requiring commercial or dual-purpose vehicles, prioritising efficiency, speed, and personal service., Family Upgraders, Families improving or expanding their current vehicle for comfort, reliability, or safety, valuing clarity, trust, and a personal approach to finance., Why These Audiences Matter, These customer groups represent a strong, sustainable market with proven creditworthiness and consistent demand. They are financially responsible buyers who seek trusted broker support, not quick-fix credit. By focusing on this segment, WHOOSH delivers lenders high-quality applications, efficient conversions, and long-term customers who are loyal to both broker and lender alike., Why Partner With WHOOSH?, Partnering with WHOOSH Finance means working with a broker that truly understands the lender's world — balancing compliance, conversion, and customer satisfaction with the speed and clarity modern finance demands., Proven Industry Experience, With over a decade of hands-on experience across automotive finance, dealer operations, and compliance, our leadership team ensures a smooth integration process, accurate submissions, and efficient communication from day one., Quality-Driven Lead Sources, We combine multiple lead channels — from trusted dealer relationships to direct-to-consumer digital campaigns — ensuring lenders receive well-qualified, motivated customers that align with their target credit profiles., Speed & Efficiency, Our digital infrastructure and experienced operations team keep deals moving quickly and accurately. We coordinate closely with customers and dealers to provide all required information upfront, enabling lenders to make fast, informed decisions., Expansion into the Leisure Market, WHOOSH is strategically positioned within the expanding leisure-vehicle space — including campervans, motorhomes, and caravans. This growing sector offers lenders access to high-quality customers investing in lifestyle and experience., Transparent, Ethical Partnership, We pride ourselves on honesty, integrity, and clear communication. The WHOOSH directors are hands-on and relationship-led, committed to building long-term partnerships based on trust, reliability, and shared growth — not short-term gain., Scalable Growth with Compliance at the Core, Every aspect of WHOOSH is built on a foundation of FCA compliance, robust processes, and data integrity. Our systems, staff training, and quality controls give lenders the assurance that every deal meets the highest industry standards., Finance Products We Broker, [{"finance_products_text":"Hire Purchase (HP)"}], Partnership Benefits, Quality Lead Generation, Pre-qualified customers with verified income and employment details, Rapid Turnaround, Aim to process applications quicker than industry standards with streamlined workflows, Transparent Commission, Clear, competitive commission structure with prompt payment terms, Risk Mitigation, Comprehensive affordability assessments and fraud prevention measures, Technology Integration, API connectivity and automated data sharing for seamless processing, Ongoing Support, Dedicated relationship management and customer service teams, Risk Management & Compliance, Risk Management & Compliance, Key Risks Identified, <p><strong>Market Competition</strong></p><p><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Focus on underserved segments and superior customer experience</p><p><strong>Regulatory Changes</strong></p><p><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Dedicated compliance officer and proactive FCA engagement</p><p><strong>Economic Downturn</strong></p><p><strong>Mitigation:</strong> Diversified revenue streams and conservative financial planning</p>, Nationwide Market Coverage, Major Markets, <p>London</p><p>Manchester</p><p>Birmingham</p><p>Glasgow</p><p>Leeds</p><p>Liverpool</p><p>Sheffield</p><p>Bristol</p><p>Edinburgh</p><p>Cardiff</p><p>Newcastle</p><p>Nottingham</p>, Strategic Advantages, <ul><li><p>• Deep local market knowledge across all UK regions</p></li><li><p>• Understanding of regional employment and economic patterns</p></li><li><p>• Growing relationships with local dealer networks</p></li><li><p>• Tailored solutions for different regional needs</p></li><li><p>• Comprehensive nationwide service capability</p></li></ul>, 3-Year Growth Strategy, Year 1: Foundation, <ul><li><p>• Establish core lender partnerships (target: 5-8 lenders)</p></li><li><p>• Build brand awareness through digital marketing</p></li><li><p>• Refine customer acquisition processes</p></li><li><p>• Achieve FCA compliance excellence</p></li><li><p>• Develop API integrations with key partners</p></li></ul>, Year 2: Expansion, <ul><li><p>• Scale lender panel to 12-15 partners</p></li><li><p>• Launch advanced credit-building products</p></li><li><p>• Expand marketing channels and partnerships</p></li><li><p>• Introduce business finance division</p></li><li><p>• Build customer referral programme</p></li></ul>, Year 3: Maturity, <ul><li><p>• Achieve market leadership in target segments</p></li><li><p>• Launch white-label broker solutions</p></li><li><p>• Expand into EV finance specialisation</p></li><li><p>• Develop proprietary credit scoring tools</p></li><li><p>• Explore strategic acquisition opportunities</p></li></ul>, Let's Build Something Together, We're seeking forward-thinking lenders who share our vision of making motor finance more accessible and transparent. Join our network and help us revolutionise the UK car finance market., 0800 123 4567, hello@whooshcarfinance.co.uk, Head Office, Unit 2, 30 Broughton Street
